# Reading-order review renders. Page images regenerated by the review and
# comparison scripts (run_reading_order_pilot.py, run_reading_order_peel_sweep.py,
# build_old_vs_new_review.py, run_llm_reader_review.py,
# compare_production_vs_candidate.py) from the PDFs in data/01_raw/. The JSON
# results, blind keys and summaries are the record; the images are not, and they
# are ~80MB.
reports/reading_order_pilot_*/assets/
reports/reading_order_peel_sweep_*/renders/
reports/old_vs_new_review_*/*.png
reports/llm_reader_review_*/images/
reports/production_vs_candidate_*/images/

